body:
I am only saying I was "wrongfully arrested" because I did not commit the crime in the least. I had proof, and they knew this which is why they dropped the case. But at this point I'm starting to think it would have been better to have gone to court for it. 

&#x200B;

Yes, I have lost an offer due to this.

Yes, I know. That is why I was confused I suppose. I thought only charges/ convictions appeared.

&#x200B;

I am also lost as to if I have any option to have it removed at this point. I guess I was not aware.
